Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been talking to a lot of young people lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.26,0:00:04.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,and when they have little work experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:06.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,they all share one wish: to "lie flat".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:09.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,So today, let's talk about lying flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.92,0:00:12.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,First of all, I think it's a brilliant idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:13.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,The problem is,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:17.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,lying flat has a bar, and you need to study it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.39,0:00:18.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,"I'll just find a so-so salary,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:22.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,a so-so job, nothing fancy, and I can rest."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.09,0:00:24.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good intention. But in my experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:25.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,this "good enough" mindset
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:27.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,usually comes with risks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.41,0:00:28.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,that people don't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:30.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,One: a so-so salary
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:31.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,doesn't mean decent freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.95,0:00:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,These jobs usually chain you to a desk,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:35.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,eating up your personal time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:36.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's not lying flat at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Two: it looks easy, but you can't slack off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.07,0:00:41.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have no energy left for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:42.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,the things you actually care about,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.51,0:00:45.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,or grow a real edge of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:47.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Three, and the biggest risk:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,low pay means very low security.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.69,0:00:51.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,When the economy turns down,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:53.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,these roles get cut first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.53,0:00:57.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that's not lying flat. That's boiling the frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.34,0:00:58.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jobs that truly let you lie flat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:00:59.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,the ones that "nourish" you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:01.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,actually have a high bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:04.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because they give you real freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.22,0:01:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,to do what you want in your spare time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:09.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do you spot such a dream company?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,One thing: structural competitiveness that leads to monopoly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:15.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here's what I've noticed:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.53,0:01:18.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't look at how big the company is,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.29,0:01:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,look at how high its compliance cost is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:23.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some businesses, nobody else can get into,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.67,0:01:25.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,because they need complex legal paperwork,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.65,0:01:28.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,deep government ties, strict industry certifications.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.55,0:01:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of that takes a lot of time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:31.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,and a lot of experienced people to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.27,0:01:34.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,They sit at a special choke point in the industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.49,0:01:37.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just like Iran guarding the Strait of Hormuz,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:40.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,they hold a structurally scarce position,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.05,0:01:41.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,which fundamentally blocks the rat race.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:45.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,No need to grind to death; the moat pays the dividend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So here's my advice:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.43,0:01:48.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,when job hunting, look for companies that are
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.57,0:01:51.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,expensive to comply, strategically valuable, conservative in hiring,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:54.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,but relatively decent to their staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.66,0:01:56.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether the economy goes up or down,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.46,0:01:57.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,these companies are rock solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:01.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,At the end of the day, real high-level lying flat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.38,0:02:04.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,comes down to one word: monopoly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.65,0:02:06.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\c&H00eac7a9}Got it?{\c&H00FFFFFF}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:07.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you enjoyed this video,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.28,0:02:11.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,please like and save it. See you next time, bye!
